{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Godway</strong> is a fast-paced platform game set on the rails.<br>All you have to do: run, jump, and make your move at the right time. As the rails lead you to the top, obstacles and gaps will try to block your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee4\ufe0f <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rail-Based Platform Action:</strong> Stay on the rails, keep moving, and don\u2019t fall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reflex-Oriented Gameplay:</strong> Speed, timing, and focus are the keys to success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Increasing Challenge:</strong> The closer you get to the summit, the harder and more dangerous the path becomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Character:</strong> Run faster, jump higher.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Atmosphere:</strong> Simple yet memorable visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Addictive Gameplay:</strong> Can mesmerize both players and viewers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you go on the rail to the top?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997850?t=1759971040","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997850/ed087f1848ae56b73a5ddc630ad5445197606c35/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759971040","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997850/14218feb9ffe6db0ce6d02f355cfa2c66c449f88/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759971040","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997850/14218feb9ffe6db0ce6d02f355cfa2c66c449f88/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759971040","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"F